Subject: [PATCH v3 6/8] nfc: s3fwrn5: Constify s3fwrn5_fw_info when not modified
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2020 18:12:17 +0200
Message-ID: <20200910161219.6237-7-krzk@kernel.org>
